    "title": "Bulk RNA-seq analysis of G2019S LRRK2 knockin primary astrocytes",
    "publication_date": "2026-09-22",
    "description": "Primary astrocytes were isolated from P1 G2019S LRRK2 knockin pups and their wildtype littermates. The cells were treated either with Etoposide(20uM) or vehicle at 18 days in vitro; cells were collected at 24 days in vitro (n=3/group). Total RNA was isolated from cell pellets, then subjected to bulk RNA-seq.",
